{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Crafted without Gen A.I. No A.I. Art]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person psychological thriller with a heavy atmosphere and elements of liminal horror. The game blends psychology, ethical dilemmas, and excellent voice narration to craft an unforgettable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the stories of your subjects by studying <strong>their</strong> personal items and <strong>darkest</strong> secrets before making <strong>life-or-death</strong> choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLEASE WISHLIST THE MILGRAM EXPERIMENT NOW!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/bbe240f9c9fa68544b62c1cd455550c8.poster.avif?t=1772104880\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/bbe240f9c9fa68544b62c1cd455550c8.webm?t=1772104880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/bbe240f9c9fa68544b62c1cd455550c8.mp4?t=1772104880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: judge, decide, terminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/82c8cc6309e2d52fee7e2481889b608f.poster.avif?t=1772104880\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/82c8cc6309e2d52fee7e2481889b608f.webm?t=1772104880\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/82c8cc6309e2d52fee7e2481889b608f.mp4?t=1772104880\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Content:</strong> Seven days of testing that will shape your destiny and lead to a unique ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Storyline:</strong> Multiple secret endings will unfold trough your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Find ways to reach the dark corners of the facility and uncover the identity of <strong>the mysterious</strong> figure you are supposed to obey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eerie Atmosphere:</strong> Realistic visuals inspired by games like <i>POOLS</i> and <i>UNRECORD</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Humor:</strong> A sharp, cynical edge to the unfolding narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersion:</strong> The main character has no backstory, their <strong>choices</strong> are your choices, their <strong>beliefs</strong> are your beliefs, and their fate is your fate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> This game\u00a0is a work of fiction inspired by real psychological studies, including the historical Milgram experiment. This game is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with Stanley Milgram, his estate, Yale University, or any official representation of the actual experiment. All characters, events, and scenarios in this game are fictional.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2719670?t=1772104880","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772104880","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/8f71fcfe8d077633cc33420326fe08e726372f49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772104880","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.st